//! The literals that clients send or receive as they are and that cannot change without breaking them: mechanism
//! names, headers, analyzer names, options, fields and the texts of errors and help (D-170). The rest of the workspace
//! names them through these constants, and test data through [`expand`].
#![forbid(unsafe_code)]

